    "source": {
      "value": "pc1"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You stalked and took down animals and other creatures of the wild. Skinning animals, harvesting their flesh, and cooking them were also part of your training, all of which can give you useful resources while you adventure.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Wisdom, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Survival skill and the Tanning Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Survey Wildlife skill feat."
    },
